<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">Malaki</book>
  <para style="h">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="mt">Malaki</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israelte kunga Mangpa puohgih Malaki akipat thu hing tung khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ken noute ka hing na itta hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi. Ahivang in nouten, “Bangchidan lam a koute nang it ahiei?” nachi uhi. “Esau khu Jakob sanggam hilou ahiei mah?” Mangpa’n achi hi. “Hinapi in Jakob ka itta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Esau ka mudata a, ataangte leh a goutante khu gamdai a si-alte a dingin ka suhsiet piehta hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Esau hahlesuon Edom mite susiet in ka umna ua,” hinanleh ka nuakia kia ding ua, mun sesate ka lamkia dinguh achi ziehun, galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; “Lamtha kia nan uleh, Keima’n ka suse dinga, Amaute gam gilou leh kumtawn a Mangpa lungthah denna nam,” achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mit un amu dinga, “Noute’n Mangpa khu Israelte gamgi henlam peh ah tawisangin um hen,” na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tapa in apa azatat a, suohin apu azatat hi. Pa ka hileh, kei nang zatatna uh hei a um ahiei? Tualeh kei apu ka hileh, kei nang zatatna uh hei a um ahiei? Galkapte Mangpa’n nou siempu Amin simmawte kungah achi hi. Hinanleh nouten, bangchidan a kouten na min ka simmaw uh ahiei? nachi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka maitam tungah tanghou suhbuasa na lan ua tualeh nouten, bangchidan a nang ka hing buasah uh ahiei? nachi uhi. Mangpa dawkan simmawhuoi na chi na uah, ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh nouten kithoina dingin ganta amitto lan u’lachin sil gilou ahi sih ding amah? Tualeh akengbai leh adamlou zawngkhal lan ulachin sil gilou hilou ding ahiei mah? Na uhpipa u’kung ah tambangte pe vawi un alungdam naimah, ahisihleh ahing na pompieh thei diei mah? Galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in Aman ahing hepi theina dingin Pasian deisahna ngen un, Tambang silpiehte na khut un abawl lai in, deisahtahin ahing sanpieh na diei? Galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka maitam tunga athawn a mei na tawkuong louna dingun, na lah uah biehinn kot kha ding mi khat beh um leh izaw! Na tung uah kipahna ka neisih a, na khut ua sillatte zong ka hing pompieh sih ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni suohna lam a kipat, nitumna lam dongin, ka min Jentelte lah ah athupi ding hi. Mun chin ah ka min a dingin gimnamtui leh sillat siengthou akilan ding hi. Aziehpen Jentelte lah ah ka min athupi ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten, Mangpa dawkan abuata hi, atunga ann sillat nangawn zong kidahhuoi na china uah na buasahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nouten, chimtahhuoi sam e, na chi ua, na hahthiei khum uhi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi. Tualeh thagum a na lahpiehte uh, akengbaite leh adamlou azawngkhal pou, kithoina dingin na hing tawi uhi, Tambanga sillat ding na hing tawite uh, na khut uapat kana sang pouma ding amah? Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh ganhonte lah a atal nei ngal a, pieh dinga zong kichiemna neita ngal a, Hinanleh Mangpa kunga kithoina dinga ganta melhem lan a zuoutat mi hamsethuohin um heh, Kei leengpa thupitah ka hi a, Namte lah ah ka min akigiin ding ahi galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tualeh tuin Nou siempute aw, tam thupieh khu noute a ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na ngaikhieh sih ua, ka min thupina dinga na lungtang ua navom utsih ua ahileh, na tung uah samsietna ka hing sawl dinga, na guolzawlna tante uh awsie ka lawkhum ding ahi, awsie ka lawkhumta hi, na lungtang ua navom utlou ziehun, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un, nahah nasuonte uh ka house dinga, na maitang uah eeh ka hing nu dinga, na pawibawlna thupite uh eeh mama ka hing nu dinga, tuate toh suoh leh sal a puimangin na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levi toh ka thuhun a umden theina dinga tam thupieh na kung ua, ka hing sawl ahi chi nathei ding uhi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amatoh ka thuhun pen, hinna leh lungmuonna thuhun ahi a, Kei ahing giin theina dinga akunga tuate ka pieh ahi. Tuachi’n ahing giingta ngut ngei a, ka min azatat mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thutah dan khu akam ah a uma, amuh ah thudihlou akimu sih hi. Hamuongtahin ka mai ah agamta a, mi tampi gitlouna apat akiheimang sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen siempute muh in theina akep ding ahi a, tualeh miten akam apat dan asui dinguh ahi, aziehpen ama galkapte Mangpa thupopa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh noute lampi apat na pielmangta ua, na dan thuhilnate un mi tampi akipalpua sahta hi. Nouten Levi thuhun na suseta uhi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ken zong mi zousiete mai ah simmawhuoitah leh zala tahin ka hing bawlta hi, ka lampite na zuilou zieh uleh, deisahtuom nei a dan thute na hil ziehuh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eite’n i bawnpi un Pa khat inei sih uh amah? Pasian in ahing siem ihisih uh amah? Bangzieha eite khat leh khat lepchietah a kibawl a ipu ipate thuhun buasah ihi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda lepchietah in agamta a, Israel gam sung leh Jerusalem khopi sungah, sil kidahhuoi akibawlta hi. Juda in Pasian dangte tanu akitenpita a, a it mama Mangpa munsiengthou abuasahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambang silbawlpa, ahilpa leh azuipa hitaleh tualeh galkapte Mangpa kunga sillat lanpa khu, Jakob puon inn apat in sattanta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sil dang na bawl nahlai uh khat tami ahi, Mangpa maitam kaa leh mauna leh nasatah a kikouna hitui in na dimsahta uhi; tuachi’n sillatte bangma in angai nawn sih a, na khut ua pat lungkimtahin asang nuom nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahivang in nouten, “Bangzieh ahiei?” na chi uhi. Aziehpen Mangpa khu nang leh lepchietah a na bawl na senzi toh kikaal a theipitu ahi; hinanleh amanu khu na kigoppina thuhun zi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasian in ni khu khat in ahing abawl sih amah? Tahsa leh hagau ah amautegel ama a ahi ua, bangzieh a nite sakhat a abawl ahiei? Aman amaute gel apat Pasian ngaisah chihah asui zieh ahi. Tuaziehin na hagau lam uah pilvang unlen, Koiman asenzi tungah lepchietah in bawl sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Aziehpen Mangpa Israelte Pasian in kikhul ka huo hi achi hi, tualeh puonsil banga pawngbawlna kikhukhum ka hua hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi. Tuaziehin na hagau lam uah pilvang unlen, na senzi tung uah lepchie sih un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na thugen un Mangpa na lunggim sahta uhi; hinanleh Nouten bangchi dan a Ama ka lunggim sah uh ahiei? na chi nalai uhi. “Michin in silgilou abawlte uh Mangpa mitmu in ahoi ahi, tualeh ama khu tuate tungah akipah hi” nachi na uah, ahisihleh thudih a vaihawm “Pasian hei a um ahiei?” nachi chieng ua Ama lunggim sah nahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai in, ka thangkoupa ka hing sawl dinga, aman ka masang ah ka lampi asiel masa ding a, na suipa uh Mangpa a biehinn ah thakhat in ahing pei ding hi; na kipahna uh, thuhun thangkoupa, Ngai un, hing pei ding ahi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh koi ahiei Ama hing pei na ni thuoh zou ding? Tualeh ahing kilat hun chiengin koi ahiei ding zou ding? “Aziehpen Ama khu halsiengpa mei bang leh puonsawppa sabon bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama khu dangka halsiengpa leh siengthousahpa bangin atou dinga, Aman Levi tapate a susieng dinga, Mangpa kunga dihtattah a sillat alat theina ding un, sana leh dangka bangin a susieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin Juda leh Jerusalem sillat khu ni danglai a bang leh tanglai kumte a bangin, Mangpa a dingin alungdam huoita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tualeh vaihawm dingin na kungnai uah ka hing pei ding a, ai san siemte, angkawmte, zuou a kichiemte, sum thalaw a nasemte, sugenthei a athaman nehpieh mite, tungah leh meithaite leh pa neiloute, nelsiete leh gamdang mite sugenthei mite leh kei hing giing loute tungah theipitu gangtah ka hi ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aziehpen Kei Mangpa ka hia, ka kiheng sih hi; Tuaziehin nou Jakob tate aw suhchimit a umlou na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh napu na pate uh hunlai akipat in ka thugousiete apat in na pielmang ua, na zui sih uhi. Ka kungah hing kile kia unlen, Kei zong noute kungah kang kile kia ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi. Hinanleh nouten Bangchi kilekia ding nachi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihingin Pasian asuom ding ahiei mah? Hinanleh nouten kei na hing suom uhi. Hinanleh nouten Nang kang bangchi suom ua ahiei? Nachi uhi. Sawm a khatte leh sillate ah kei nang suom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hamse law a samsiet na hita uh, nang suomtah ziehun, na nam pumpi nangawn un kei nang suomta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka inn a neh ding ann a um theina dingin, sawm a khat zousie bu pangah hing koi unlen, tamte in hing enkhie un, van kotkhate hongin, akoina ding umlou khop in na tung uah guolzawlna ka hing sungbaw sih mawng eimah, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noute ziehin na haichi uh negamte ka phawh dinga, amaun na lei gate uh asuse sih ding ua, na lou ua grepguite zong nou a dingin galouin a um sih ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n nam zousieten noute mihampha ahing chi ding uhi, aziehpen gam kipah umtah na hi ding uh, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kei douna a na thugente uh akhau thei mama hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Hinanleh nouten, Nang douna in bangthu ka gen ngel uoi? na chi nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nouten Pasian nasep amawhna ahi, adan thute izui a, galkapte Mangpa mai a shisunte banga i um ua adeilam isui uh, bang phatuom ahiei? nachi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, akiliensahte hampha isa ua, ahi, gitlouna bawlte alawching ua, Pasian ze ette nangawn hutkhiet in aum uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa zau mite khat lekhat akihou ua, Mangpa’n angaikhie a, aza hi. Tuachi’n thei ngitngetna laibu khat Ama mai ah, Mangpa giing mite leh amin ngaituote a dingin akigiel ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Amaute ka goumanpha a ka bawl nichieng in, amauh kei a ahi ding uhi. Mi’n anasem atapa akhawi bangin amaute ka khawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin, nouten midihtat leh migilou, kikaal leh Pasian nasem mi leh semlou mi kikaal thu na theikhen theita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai un, lungthu khuh sunga meikuong banga kaatna ni hing tung ding ahi; mikiliensah zousie, ahi, giloutaha gamtate zousie khu bupawl bang ahi ding ua, tua ni hing tungin amauh akatum ding hi, Tuachi’n ahui leh aba, bangma anuasie sih ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh ka min giing noute a dingin, dihtatna Ni, ahate a suhdamna toh ahing suoh ding hi. Tualeh na pawtdoh ding ua, bawngbuh a bawngnou vahthau bangin na khanglien ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam silte ka bawl ni chiengin nouten migiloute na tuonchil ding ua, na kephang nuoi ua vutvai ahi ding uhi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka suohpa Mosi kunga ka pieh dan Israel mi zousie a dinga, Horeb muol a ka thupieh, thugousiete leh vaihawmnate thei ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“En un, Mangpa ni thupitah leh zauhuoitah ahing tun masangin, guolnei Elijah ka hing sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’n pate lungtang tate lam ah, tualeh tate lungtang pate lam ah akihei sah ding hi, tuachilouin ka hing pei dinga, leitung hamsiein ka gawt ding hi.”
  </para>
</usx>
